I do not see this behavior, on my machine running current [main](https://github.com/antirez/ds4/commit/d615ab08c8bce9b8242963ecece5aed6b5a79367), the response gets correctly split into `reasoning_content` and `content` delta parts.

Note that there were some recent fixes regarding `ds4-server` and reasoning token encapsulation, so make sure you run the latest commit.

